---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SkillTree from "../components/SkillTree.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About — Roshan Kumar"
	description="Background, philosophy, and technical focus of Roshan Kumar."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pt-32 pb-32 sm:px-10">
		<header class="mb-14 space-y-3">
			<span
				class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30 block"
			>
				Profile // About
			</span>
			<h1
				class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl"
			>
				I build software that respects your hardware.
			</h1>
			<p class="text-base text-white/50 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
				CS student, open-source maintainer, and tinkerer. Focused on
				native performance, clean architectures, and zero-bullshit
				engineering.
			</p>
		</header>

		<div class="space-y-12 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/60">
			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white">
					The Backstory
				</h2>
				<p>
					Most of my projects start with a moment of pure annoyance.
					I'll be using an app on my Linux laptop or phone, notice it
					takes 5 seconds to respond to a click or burns through
					battery while sitting idle, and decide that whatever problem
					it's solving can be done significantly better with native
					code and actual optimization.
				</p>
				<p>
					That attitude led to <a
						href="/projects/shonenx"
						class="text-white underline underline-offset-4 decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-white transition-colors"
						>ShonenX</a
					>, an open-source media discovery client that compiles
					natively to Dart and delegates playback to <code
						class="text-white/80 bg-white/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-code text-sm font-mono"
						>libmpv</code
					> instead of spinning up an Electron instance. It also drove me
					to write <a
						href="/projects/byte-me"
						class="text-white underline underline-offset-4 decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-white transition-colors"
						>byte_me</a
					> when default Flutter download packages kept stuttering the UI
					on 500MB media files.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white">
					What I Care About
				</h2>
				<ul class="space-y-3">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 bg-white/40 shrink-0"></span>
						<span
							><strong class="text-white font-medium"
								>Native compilation over web wrappers:</strong
							> Electron and Tauri have their place, but native Dart/Flutter
							or compiled systems software will always win on battery,
							RAM, and tactile responsiveness.</span
						>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 bg-white/40 shrink-0"></span>
						<span
							><strong class="text-white font-medium"
								>Privacy and zero telemetry:</strong
							> No tracking SDKs, no third-party ad networks, no analytics
							beacons watching what users click.</span
						>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 bg-white/40 shrink-0"></span>
						<span
							><strong class="text-white font-medium"
								>Tinkering with system internals:</strong
							> Bypassing Android Scoped Storage with Shizuku, playing
							with kernel Binder IPC, and figuring out how things work
							under the hood.</span
						>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-6 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
				<div>
					<h2 class="text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white">
						Skill Tree
					</h2>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/40">
						Core competencies and areas of active exploration.
					</p>
				</div>
				<SkillTree />
			</section>

			<section
				class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm text-white/40"
			>
				<span>Interested in collaborating or talking systems?</span>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/roshancodespace"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="text-white hover:underline transition-colors"
				>
					github.com/roshancodespace &nearr;
				</a>
			</section>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
